<DocsLayout title="Roadmap">
  <p>The <a href="https://github.com/alexey-a-abramov/markrust/blob/main/ROADMAP.md">repository roadmap</a> is the current source of truth. This page summarizes the public plan.</p>

  <h2>Current v0.1 alpha release gate</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Manual macOS CJK IME validation for body text, wrapped lines, tables, code-language chips, image captions, and frontmatter fields</li>
    <li>Release archive smoke tests and checksum-backed package distribution</li>
    <li>Native GUI smoke testing alongside the automated Rust and website suites</li>
    <li>Remote-image privacy and safety hardening</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Shipped in v0.1 alpha</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Typora-style WYSIWYG editing, plus Source and Split modes</li>
    <li>Folder workspace with file tree</li>
    <li>Document outline and command palette</li>
    <li>GFM tables, task lists, images, frontmatter, and code highlighting</li>
    <li>HTML export CLI</li>
    <li>Autosave, atomic writes, and external-edit reconciliation</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Next, guided by alpha feedback</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Windows support</li>
    <li>Save As dialog</li>
    <li>Workspace-wide search</li>
    <li>Custom keybindings</li>
    <li>Accessibility improvements</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Deliberately deferred</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Git UI integration</li>
    <li>Cloud sync and accounts</li>
    <li>Plugin marketplace and MCP/agent server</li>
    <li>Full TeX/LaTeX and Mermaid rendering</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
